{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"liusima-e-o128","title":"温恢谓裴潜：畏征南有变，关羽骁锐乘利而进必将为患","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-078a2458c190e288466b","label":"正文","text":"温恢谓裴潜：畏征南有变，关羽骁锐乘利而进必将为患","evidence":["liusima-q-1c84f108fba1f8eb0177"]},{"id":"liusima-a-30c4281c1830752024d2","label":"正文","text":"诏书召裴潜及豫州刺史吕贡等，潜等缓之","evidence":["liusima-q-bd00b9264e01dddc4564"]},{"id":"liusima-a-0263dd96af9baf85ad85","label":"正文","text":"温恢密语裴潜：此必襄阳之急，一二日必有密书促进道","evidence":["liusima-q-1044bbd2c5b448daf2ce"]},{"id":"liusima-a-05f59c167b6bd1fffe78","label":"正文","text":"裴潜受言轻装速发，果被促令；张辽等寻各见召，如恢所策","evidence":["liusima-q-67f17a01695c1f34d245"]}],"participants":[{"person":"chengguo-p0023","role":"谓裴潜，此间虽有贼不足忧，而畏征南方有变；今水生而子孝悬军无有远备，关羽骁锐乘利而进必将为患，于是有樊城之事；密语潜，此必襄阳之急欲赴之也，所以不为急会者不欲惊动远众，一二日必有密书促卿进道；张辽等又将被召，辽等素知王意，后召前至，卿受其责","evidence":["liusima-q-1c84f108fba1f8eb0177","liusima-q-1044bbd2c5b448daf2ce"]},{"person":"dongyuan-p0182","role":"兖州刺史，受言；受诏书召，缓之；受其言，置辎重，更为轻装速发，果被促令","evidence":["liusima-q-1c84f108fba1f8eb0177","liusima-q-bd00b9264e01dddc4564","liusima-q-1044bbd2c5b448daf2ce","liusima-q-67f17a01695c1f34d245"]},{"person":"liusima-p0016","role":"豫州刺史，受诏书召","evidence":["liusima-q-bd00b9264e01dddc4564"]},{"person":"wudi-p0178","role":"等寻各见召，如恢所策","evidence":["liusima-q-67f17a01695c1f34d245"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-1c84f108fba1f8eb0177","liusima-q-bd00b9264e01dddc4564","liusima-q-1044bbd2c5b448daf2ce","liusima-q-67f17a01695c1f34d245"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-1c84f108fba1f8eb0177","source_order":[15,206,133],"order":3338}],"persons":[{"id":"liusima-p0016","name":"吕贡","evidence":["liusima-q-bd00b9264e01dddc4564"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-1044bbd2c5b448daf2ce","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-bbb8a7d1595758446f03","layer":"original","quote":"恢密语潜曰：“此必襄阳之急欲赴之也。所以不为急会者〖11〗，不欲惊动远众；一二日，必有密书促卿进道。张辽等又将被召，辽等素知王意。后召前至，卿受其责矣","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":205,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":231,"end":306,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-1c84f108fba1f8eb0177","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-bbb8a7d1595758446f03","layer":"original","quote":"恢谓兖州刺史裴潜曰〖7〗：“此间虽有贼，不足忧；而畏征南方有变〖8〗。今水生而子孝悬军〖9〗，无有远备；关羽骁锐，乘利而进，必将为患。”于是有樊城之事","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":205,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":133,"end":208,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-67f17a01695c1f34d245","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-bbb8a7d1595758446f03","layer":"original","quote":"潜受其言，置辎重，更为轻装速发，果被促令〖12〗。辽等寻各见召，如恢所策","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":205,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":308,"end":344,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-bd00b9264e01dddc4564","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-bbb8a7d1595758446f03","layer":"original","quote":"诏书召潜及豫州刺史吕贡等。潜等缓之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":205,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":213,"end":230,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
